      "body": [
        {
          "s": "Interviewer",
          "t": "So, tell me a bit about yourself and why you are interested in this internship."
        },
        {
          "s": "You",
          "t": "Sure. I am currently a first-year master student in <em>Finance</em> at Peking University."
        },
        {
          "s": "You",
          "t": "I am interested in this internship because your team focuses on <em>equity research</em>, which is exactly the area I want to build a career in."
        },
        {
          "s": "Interviewer",
          "t": "Good. What do you think is your biggest <em>strength</em> that you bring to the team?"
        },
        {
          "s": "You",
          "t": "I would say it is the combination of <em>analytical rigor</em> and communication skills."
        }
      ]
    },
